OL,3,GNEWSAInmates restore 16 bikes for
OL,4,Ahomeless people
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prison scheme which sees inmates
OL,7,Frefurbish hundreds of bikes has donated
OL,8,F16 bicycles to homeless people in the
OL,9,FNorth East.
OL,11,FCornerstone, a homeless charity with
OL,12,Fhubs in Bishop Auckland and Hartlepool,
OL,13,Fsaid many homeless people struggle to
OL,14,Fattend appointments due to poor public
OL,15,Ftransport in rural areas.
OL,17,FThe charity's communication and support
OL,18,Flead, Nicky Morson, said the team had
OL,19,Ftaken a 10-hour trip to HMP Addiewell
OL,20,Fin Scotland and met prisoners recycling
OL,21,Fbikes in the prison's onsite Bike Shed,
OL,22,Ffounded in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
