OL,3,GNEWSAInmates restore 16 bikes for
OL,4,Ahomeless people
OL,5,
OL,6,FLawrie Warke, Addiewell's bicycle
OL,7,Fmaintenance instructor, said it was
OL,8,F"brilliant" to be able to help
OL,9,FCornerstone, adding the work allowed
OL,10,Finmates to give back to communities.
